.TH TULPAR-CLEAN 1 "2026" "tulpar 0.4.0" "Tulpar Manual"
.SH NAME
tulpar-clean \- purge downloaded package archives and metadata cache
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tulpar clean
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B tulpar c
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B tulpar \-c
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B tulpar autoclean
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Purges downloaded package archives, temporary git clone workspaces, and
cached repository metadata from the package cache directory
.RI ( /var/cache/apg
or user cache directory).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-y ", " \-\-yes
Assume yes and skip the confirmation prompt.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, non-zero on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tulpar (1),
.BR tulpar-install (1),
.BR tulpar-upgrade (1)
